+    _choice_push_waivers;判定 _choice_push_judge(回報上限論文 2.3);擋下記 blocked(同一個 B 同一組原因不重記)。
+    生效日比今天晚時整圈不跑(環境變數覆寫的印一行「被環境變數關掉」)。"""
+    P = "[spec-gate 推送前]"
+    since = _choice_since()
+    if since > time.strftime("%Y-%m-%d"):
+        if os.environ.get("LUMOS_CHOICE_SINCE", "").strip() == since and _choice_push_has_kotlin(rr):
